  "description": "If Robespierre didn’t become involved in the human’s rebellion, his destiny would have been quite different. Following the election of Magena, he would have sided with her in order to become her Advisor and Chief of Police. He would become the protector of the voters and would never fail in his duty. However, some rumors would have emerged concerning a brief romance between him and the woman who is steering the Republic. Rumors, which would have been the source of a cruel period called the “Terror.” Certain rather chatty citizens would have been stopped for questionable motives. The severed head of some unfortunate wretch would have served as an example and put an end to this gossip...",
